  "notes": "{増|ま}す is a godan verb meaning \"to increase\" or \"to grow.\" Can be transitive or intransitive.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Can be both transitive and intransitive\n- Compare: ⟦{増|ふ}える→増える：01183_fueru⟧ (intransitive), ⟦{増|ふ}やす→増やす：02410_fuyasu⟧ (transitive) - more common in everyday speech\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{勢|いきお}い→勢い：01782_ikioi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{増|ま}す: to gain momentum\n- ⟦{重要性|じゅうようせい}→重要性：04823_juuyousei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{増|ま}す: to grow in importance\n- ⟦{速度|そくど}→速度：03319_sokudo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{増|ま}す: to increase speed\n- ⟦{輝|かがや}き→輝き：21706_kagayaki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{増|ま}す: to shine more brightly\n\nREGISTER:\n{増|ま}す is more literary/formal than ⟦{増|ふ}える→増える：01183_fueru⟧. Common in written language and news.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{減|へ}る→減る：01985_heru⟧: to decrease (opposite)\n- ⟦ますます→ますます：01604_masumasu⟧: more and more, increasingly",
